  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89d26bd87f7fe4658642b79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然准备得不够充分，\r\n但我会设法靠干劲弥补！\r\n请你好好看着我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca6bb934e3985fc23403bde9ec6db4fc49fbdfbe23169f50824e81ba540796f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb496e304daaa6fbb226d577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要尽力拿出最好的表现……\r\n不能让大家失望……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "450fb697978aae2a1444e4b3c452528dd665f4743a66fad4584a6a016a58ce33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f425f8482776d2bc27440fe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有、有好多看起来\r\n很厉害的姐姐……\r\n我不能输给她们……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5afa55c96cf53b7fa67369e07a733389ca2ebd261e297de4a359d298dc29da5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdd9acac3cc8b3441178dbe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以退缩。\r\n我是有实力的孩子，\r\n小花是有实力的孩子……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0d0ee4b099f722d22e2ddcbcca684f46f25a5f87517d0513155ebe38307d2f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bebced655c5405dbf47bef00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定没问题的，\r\n我会努力不让你担心……\r\n所以可以给我一点鼓励吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a48cf2e68d4c7e7eed576393a0027fb732b09be12ef5528aece6c57cbcbb564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c98781b82fec9b4550fd29e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdea77b33aeaec916717deb674c10b49445b607aad8c9a51a8f916ddb616c89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e8303b079cb64e86dd27b8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也做得到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dd3224fa34cec835f6a0477a86d85adef8a577b77ce24f84656146f88444247",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4290dd9e040a2d254eb22196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定做得到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e38940ef1122aab425909a066e66eab0f5a6db7462b2aea434c4d3d0ce448e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:984746537c5b8ecd7d0cd8cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "82fec3801d176574a5c73b753c0428097ba4efacd01f74d8bbeb0f256d85692f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5298fe3dc1cce8f1d2c4c9ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bc39db2e170c7b11a6319e462abd2ecacb4a74a3b68714270959d122866508d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ae825068555e2f11544384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511a807a9d9cda4f33422ff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a04d04d52000bc3c65ff020a3a17508977c2abf6de9748fe56add63fd3b7ce4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cfad9d1076c8508918546c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8e8f6457665359be62cf86cbfaa101577f74f86129525a02d6f7cda02c6a2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cfebe10d70525aa22c434b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得比以前优秀一点了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "27cec073d8ae8b6dd6caa367e7b5ca1a864283769f201e8b91a7551be17068e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6154bb5f0a9dacb4e2eea94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……受你照顾了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32eb37e03ab33ce9f9084d76d6d20ef0c56964dfbedb3122de20c1ab4b813700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96f56e8a6a5e8c7a5099bd72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，请多指教了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85bfac83000b57a350d499bbf5d2b562a63e4a1e562476aa407345b0dd832e3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:344aca9940a16e7d1633dc0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b58d964d17854a803d16140a894079104ae8c9281e306d5f49a7ec42fc0837d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c1c08015b1640e2a98cad60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "550c4522147e4bf9b6188cc3b70ec18899b04f3af5dee4e5550248f8f45b57e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d396dd9b0cbb899efc9c43c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……受你照顾了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32eb37e03ab33ce9f9084d76d6d20ef0c56964dfbedb3122de20c1ab4b813700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfed4de405ffd6a1c139b64d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体状况没问题，也没忘记带东西。\r\n接下来只要全力奔跑就好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad9b71ea2c88b1fa57ea0f316dc0fe9239e9778a6dccab27fff91d9cdddb0c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:276fd38971c0300635df17cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要去使出我现在的全力，\r\n跑出不输大家的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b67e9926392c72d9a9ec093c66a9f0eed667744275960bfc9d1e29adf1dfca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38385ed8c07bfdfcb7917fd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……受你照顾了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32eb37e03ab33ce9f9084d76d6d20ef0c56964dfbedb3122de20c1ab4b813700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe5b4f3ecf022dc37a9d7dc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行きますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "345500165fab998e63affd13b276f3aa139999f24a80aac81c09c5850c485f17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:872fa6fdb7c5a10c8e38eb0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要完全绽放……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5661694c936cee68114dbfbdf4b4822f22a92444ddf5bd00cdc6410d99030ad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df498a0e2b11b7860bc4b255",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也……想跑出更好的名次……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69d756c402e44b8526114b41c18436e51e1ff4e171f6f4a422d039f80260c222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7c2847bf0ae8a27ef21e41b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才不会只绽放一半就结束！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5859587c1de1591597489b7c42531f7fa88dba89adc7c85880c80c0fd448174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dff8800a816595ea191d5019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须更加……更加努力才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "40fa1d4292fa705967e5bbe1810aa7b2c411c29f7b44bc00706dabef9ed27079",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd272415dfef1acd45884e47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿♪\r\n为你送上勇气的花束……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a1caf50bae590a4598fde2f1ab0dff20588ded5d8b028880487cf11266dca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:256ecd2e0f4e4d9bf46472ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，绽放得很漂亮呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "efbff68d8210ff376badf0155f1c2ca76ae8eee5e1291f4439be6dbb05149162",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2783da3f7d35a897aa2a3508",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我遵守了和你之间的誓言喔……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf409a2dba992c4c0658e0e6d89f57a80946066e747c4b4da82fac90ca9ad526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e85660ade0e47fd57e65a89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，绽放得很漂亮呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "efbff68d8210ff376badf0155f1c2ca76ae8eee5e1291f4439be6dbb05149162",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98d13c7905be942aa00f6ef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be2fa41efa23b67438648eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊～！呵呵呵，啊哈♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf72000e5d7d138029273e87772e5039f0449abdcbd575972e1a3edd77b25a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb05088f0e4ab7e83733098f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得受人托付，\r\n得好好加油才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4129e2abb28e65cf02b08e44116b6847a719bd85e96dce146facb0b672f9121c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fece322a89fda92b2255df82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想从旁守护Beauty小姐，\r\n让她的内心至少得到一点宽慰。\r\n我能做的就只有这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4110e9da94138f77f6e5ac8c794d7dbaeff5b74b2d3f78d93a942e9740c1f689",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ae05f1b7da8804369a7cc81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未来一定……就在前方！呵呵呵，\r\n我的花田，绽放、盛开，变得广阔吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d29ebbae1ea90b6f5d32aaf34714da372eddd849aa1e3e8a722c7d05b7f0c6e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff1d5c7de00ea311b97cc64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸妈妈看到我的这身打扮后\r\n哭了出来，害我吓一大跳呢……\r\n呼……幸好他们是喜极而泣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "574ce7d391528cb4ce25a5a4e57d9a180b8adea4ad547052d65b53ea16e7a39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:516c02688c5b4d25de2ccd91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人家常说「这不是终点而是起点」\r\n对吧？……呵呵，往后的路上\r\n也要请你继续多多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f1e6e6b3fb61338a9de901ab17e002b770895e2151ce0b2194ffd997f16e8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:849aa5b54030d11f60859d2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定有美好的邂逅在等着我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a62a442be48f68e0bce23d4f54e8e8b91f485f745f17bd64a4d87cbe4d989e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bc626f8ba267fa09ce7ce7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇……！那里一定有我的……\r\n嗯……呼啊，找到了……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce8ee4409c52100bd7ae812e9ddac81c3a154fcbc210a7ede4f8d2cd38bdc83a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ff6a5178f363689fa671b95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力唱歌♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b62bad03e7f33423bb97b688c8ae17fdbafa926f66765cbc5039551255ed328",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4cfe67f68d91917587c28d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家绽放灿烂的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "202d72a283983e71f73bf1a264e3eb2e8fbea8f66d869e487b5d6a4c164254d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc215fd0116e52f215386645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想赶快成为能独当一面的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ee3c7c9f8c0e235130b6f61e7ec3be1a3dee1eb45b47a0af58b0b03ab0ad3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8064a6243762c3fee0d539a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员之间的回忆，\r\n就像太阳一样温暖……\r\n能够带给我勇气♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "89e4879d07bb04d3635eb6978e536eb77f1e9396d411d847658e125e10a31312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d33dc42478d7d0c9583c72f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不让别人说我配不上这件衣服，\r\n我要成为优秀的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a98ce5a0b3f44a5864bc379c2faa0058996a83617b6efced34ee0ed996c9c626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18d847fa05aa01d12440474e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很可爱，但会露出肚脐……\r\n让我觉得有点不好意思，嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e5a3e3b0ea71b7f4a508b015925512e30960745e72aaa7633d5c6cc0ae0f81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da81182a87f7139e6a5e7f4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘地，\r\n像花一样非常漂亮呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe77c87359cefafeade7383c611cd6c18ff3bab314c554661ce73ad0986d9fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ea3fe133e2ea9883908342",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也有买尺寸比较大的制服♪\r\n因为我觉得一定会……\r\n不断长大……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2cff715ef5e4dacf4bf13a60451d60f57b7626205f7b35b542fa8e09e73039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e263de1c6bd7a497b911cb2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了在大舞台上也能让人看见，\r\n我会努力跳舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f08103b9150eab3e715d5003ad627317e106e3441227c1d85588ad5c9cac142a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb03906f2ab7d35df36c1dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在还是朵小花……但总有一天\r\n要像这件决胜服一样盛大绽放♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf9331ea1316f7995c58b30a7c5d2dbee7291bf7a9181a07117807202e0328ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae8f5da4d4c3ae96ad986c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……我有一点点紧张……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbfdee2e7bca8af84dabca66a954448365695366922cbde2f4b294db440dacfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29eb90bbfc5351f0d2afd4e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够穿上这么漂亮的婚纱……\r\n我好幸福♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0723b0a3db24b24164cb3ca39c057baed3787c7131801b2b2b7e74fd1f075a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50be063ed540ea41de72d0eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎、怎么样？\r\n我穿起来……好看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "62bfad0f36e2f90445e2e1fcff80e493a9fd1f200b06465ff4bf8f1682288e25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e4090cb8aacc0626742481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然能穿这么棒的衣服……\r\n嘿嘿，我好开心喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d861721e7b6abf8bd2ad2a64270087ecb912e977be21b5a9f054ffa7e7beefd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c17e2a9f6ee0afaf2069260b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "きちんとしてるねって、\r\nみなさんほめてくれます…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce9c6d40cfeb417d0a1b8e3c04e9dcb20fde948dba87e5ab5770cf8859b159f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d08845d2aed241403c1b5f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赤いお靴、お気に入りなんです。\r\n歩くときに、つい下を見ちゃうくらい♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c2199d87bdf5ce904a4c88b419b990b8b98e0919ecaa1f4d8d6cae5e8bba7a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b781f2f5d829e00f638e58f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不让别人说我配不上这件衣服，\r\n我要成为优秀的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a98ce5a0b3f44a5864bc379c2faa0058996a83617b6efced34ee0ed996c9c626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33cb0abbc70c0b8e42b0f7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很可爱，但会露出肚脐……\r\n让我觉得有点不好意思，嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e5a3e3b0ea71b7f4a508b015925512e30960745e72aaa7633d5c6cc0ae0f81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a87997b0460089466fe8df0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘地，\r\n像花一样非常漂亮呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe77c87359cefafeade7383c611cd6c18ff3bab314c554661ce73ad0986d9fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
