      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:662ce9550b3b27d62cddaa9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够穿上这么漂亮的婚纱……\r\n我好幸福♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0723b0a3db24b24164cb3ca39c057baed3787c7131801b2b2b7e74fd1f075a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5c119a52cbafb032f2e610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎、怎么样？\r\n我穿起来……好看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "62bfad0f36e2f90445e2e1fcff80e493a9fd1f200b06465ff4bf8f1682288e25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44ee3cdad666954cda23afb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然能穿这么棒的衣服……\r\n嘿嘿，我好开心喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d861721e7b6abf8bd2ad2a64270087ecb912e977be21b5a9f054ffa7e7beefd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55d350584927cf4a45b03c0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5990b51ca948c3eeb396e2e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我还不成熟，\r\n但请与我切磋一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c41730f058e72ce1afb5a53327dced36b2275eae51aaba101c21b4e422653e81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08172978d305cbf9a7e5a05c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害……！\r\n我也必须追上去才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ab012b553f9878d4ee8cc32e1b73009a74e9624fc1d18911b5e747cd732685",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f29136c67ac64fb83ed66c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安♪\r\n……嘿嘿。\r\n今天也要充满精神地努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3978f6a95e0470b1e67821c7221f4162efdec74d6fb63aafe85bfa6d77730b2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:962c3e31d628ee9f9907df0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，你上面的头发睡到翘起来了……\r\n像猫咪一样可爱呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "391444a0837009a73e3f31cfbb4d33b3a0d488793e793186a5c2c3c9caf1b62e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1d35d9f15f41dde6896b57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有好好吃饭吗？\r\n如果你最近很忙，\r\n我可以帮你做饭团！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b4165dfe86429188079c4460ed8a54d35a5baf694b0094e0955ae04afba1a87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07c13c91f1473fcc7f2fb48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃饱后就会想睡觉呢……\r\n只要用力揉耳朵，\r\n就会变得清醒喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e95639b77571a1efd26c5fb6d7029566212b5b4d613e6a7a8e97344605dfbeaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f924bb7fb4078c399029717",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须趁天黑前回去。\r\n晚上有很多恐怖的东西……\r\n例如……幽灵之类的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad477f29bf19a8106ae0e26a87c69b178d685d286794e6001999f7556d93e7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aceefc335274f43487162037",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家说能睡的孩子长得快……\r\n但到底该睡多久才好？\r\n训练员，你知道吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab5b8e8cd847c3f8c84122dad89a0ee948b0ca67efb47e889608ba92126610c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fc14bf74a66b0d1d00deaed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花朵和学园都到了萌芽的季节♪\r\n我也要……\r\n成为更加成熟的姐姐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a716d57ad2c2b3fea0725d9a038027fcf27084f686070217fdaa23f4bd658894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48fdf74c6bf5c14048626b21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都会事先备好饮料和盐糖。\r\n抗暑对策做得非常完美！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a55f7d4b1675d0adad185dac34b52867fa57b5d11097f85c1375f91f259ca4bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14cf90fa7fb2848c5eaccf7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天有许多好吃的蔬菜和水果♪\r\n今天要做什么好呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d04701ed164aed37fa87b9a5fd15160c49cf9ea4da001d65b144a31850a40c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8faf369a75283ca397e802f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近天气很冷呢。\r\n我织了围巾和手套……\r\n要不要再帮你织个耳罩？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50eee02da2c7b7baf6c2755f5d889893c521601646eee46b873f9e7b2dfe6bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b96da1afd32a78d57a93a7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你喜欢日式还是西式早餐呢？\r\n为了让你在重要的一天里，能够有个\r\n幸福的开始，我想为你尽一份力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4ceb219bbb36a7c336c3080452d27fd39cedb1ffb306079f889ce795321aeb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90010"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
